        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 8090, Ornate Victoria Lockset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Victoria Entry Door Lockset is beautiful in its ornateness. The fancy stylings of the backplate go especially well with finishes with natural highlights like Oil Rubbed Bronze and French Antique; but this Victoria Entry Door Lockset will look just as stunning in more modern colors like Satin Nickel. The Victoria Style Sideplate Lockset has a 3-5/8 inch center to center. It will fit standard 2-1/8 inch door preparations with door thicknesses ranging from 1-1/4 inches to 2-3/4 inches thick and with backsets of 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fancy Victoria Entry Door Lockset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass latch with saw-proof insert.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Emtek Victoria Entry Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 7-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Bore Hole Spacing (distance between deadbolt and lever latch): 3-5/8\" Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Doors Thickness: 1-1/4\" - 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: Full 1\" Throw</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-8090-specifications.pdf?v=1704262347\"><b>Emtek 8090 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a knob/lever operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-8090-finish.jpg?v=1704354605\" width=\"431\" height=\"115\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek 8090 Available Finishes\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Victoria Entry Door Lockset",
                "description": "The Victoria Entry Door Lockset is beautiful in its ornateness. The fancy stylings of the backplate go especially well with finishes with natural highlights like Oil Rubbed Bronze and French Antique; but this Victoria Entry Door Lockset will look just as stunning in more modern colors like Satin Nickel. The Victoria Style Sideplate Lockset has a 3-5/8 inch center to center. It will fit standard 2-1/8 inch door preparations with door thicknesses ranging from 1-1/4 inches to 2-3/4 inches thick and with backsets of 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.\r\n",
                "keywords": "Ornate Victoria Locksets, Victoria Entry Door Locksets, Emtek 8090, Emtek 8095, EMT-8090, EMT-8095, Fancy Victoria Entry Door Locksets, Emtek Victoria Entry Sets, Victoria Style Sideplate Locksets, traditional handlesets, ornate handlesets, Victorian handlesets,"
